        "\n",
        "# Introduction to Regular Expressions (Regex)\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook is the \"exercise sheet\" for week 2 of the NLP lecture and introduces **regular expressions (regex)**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Goals:\n",
        "- Understand what regex is and why it's useful\n",
        "- Learn the most common regex symbols\n",
        "- Practice using regex in Python\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "cf5ec20a",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "cf5ec20a"
      },
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## 1. What is a Regular Expression?\n",
        "\n",
        "A **regular expression** is a pattern used to **search, match, or manipulate text**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Typical use cases:\n",
        "- Validating input (emails, phone numbers)\n",
        "- Searching logs or data files\n",
        "- Extracting information from text\n",
        "\n",
        "Regex is supported by many languages (Python, JavaScript, Java, etc.).\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "### Online resources:\n",
        "- Documentation and tutorials: [regexone](https://regexone.com)\n",
        "- Visual debugger/regex analyser: [regex101](https://regex101.com)\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "318f3f80",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "318f3f80"
      },
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## 2. Regex in Python\n",
        "\n",
        "Python provides the `re` module for working with regular expressions.\n",
        "\n",
        "Common functions:\n",
        "- `re.search()` – find first match\n",
        "- `re.findall()` – find all matches\n",
        "- `re.match()` – match from start of string\n",
        "- `re.sub()` – replace matches\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 75,
      "id": "4c37100a",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 34
        },
        "id": "4c37100a",
        "outputId": "bc323855-bfef-4c29-c9a3-6673753c9899"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "data": {
            "application/vnd.google.colaboratory.intrinsic+json": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "text/plain": [
              "'world'"
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 75,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "import re\n",
        "\n",
        "text = \"Hello world\"\n",
        "match = re.search(r\"world\", text)\n",
        "match.group() if match else None\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "8d426a94",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8d426a94"
      },
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## 3. Literal Characters\n",
        "\n",
        "The simplest regex is just a **literal string**.\n",
        "\n",
        "The pattern `cat` matches the exact text \"cat\".\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 76,
      "id": "5d6e2c0d",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "5d6e2c0d",
        "outputId": "d12b0444-95d7-410d-a573-604c07d731f1"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "['cat', 'cat', 'cat']"
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 76,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "re.findall(r\"cat\", \"cat scatter catalog\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "797a62ea",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "797a62ea"
      },
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## 4. Special Characters\n",
        "\n",
        "Some characters have special meanings:\n",
        "\n",
        "| Symbol | Meaning |\n",
        "|------|--------|\n",
        "| `.` | any character |\n",
        "| `\\d` | digit (0–9) |\n",
        "| `\\w` | word character |\n",
        "| `\\s` | whitespace |\n",
        "| `+` | one or more |\n",
        "| `*` | zero or more |\n",
        "| `?` | optional |\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "c8915fe7",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "c8915fe7",
        "outputId": "1f67b5fb-4c36-436a-9d7f-104658075aa6"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# write a regex pattern to match 'cat', 'cut', and 'cot', but not \"coat\"\n",
        "pattern = r\"\"\n",
        "re.findall(pattern, \"cat cut cot coat\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "76c70ed5",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "76c70ed5"
      },
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## 5. Character Classes\n",
        "\n",
        "Character classes match **one character** from a set.\n",
        "\n",
        "Examples:\n",
        "- `[abc]` → a, b, or c\n",
        "- `[a-z]` → any lowercase letter\n",
        "- `[0-9]` → any digit\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 79,
      "id": "2da176a5",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "2da176a5",
        "outputId": "7fda981f-10d0-4852-eb74-34b29da38927"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "['e', 'u', 'a', 'e', 'e', 'i', 'o']"
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 79,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "re.findall(r\"[aeiou]\", \"regular expressions\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "41662158",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "41662158"
      },
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## 6. Quantifiers\n",
        "\n",
        "Quantifiers say **how many times** a pattern should occur.\n",
        "\n",
        "| Quantifier | Meaning |\n",
        "|----------|---------|\n",
        "| `*` | 0 or more |\n",
        "| `+` | 1 or more |\n",
        "| `{n}` | exactly n |\n",
        "| `{n,m}` | between n and m |\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 80,
      "id": "9f8b40ca",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "9f8b40ca",
        "outputId": "23f89e9b-46f5-4e7f-de81-3c19487bc88e"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "['aaaa', 'aa', 'a']"
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 80,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "re.findall(r\"a+\", \"caaaab aa a\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "f5c0b7f3",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "f5c0b7f3"
      },
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## 7. Anchors\n",
        "\n",
        "Anchors match **positions**, not characters.\n",
        "\n",
        "| Symbol | Meaning |\n",
        "|------|--------|\n",
        "| `^` | start of string |\n",
        "| `$` | end of string |\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 81,
      "id": "de648ece",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "de648ece",
        "outputId": "83310eeb-c553-4232-e2fe-968541fc1ec4"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "['Hello']"
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 81,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "re.findall(r\"^Hello\", \"Hello world\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "rUD8YHVym_yj",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
